    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play the Demo First</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/aa25b5341f8dee2f4be6ae968896ad7e.avif?t=1755493236\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp\u2014all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there\u2019s always a reason to send a little joy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp\u2014all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there\u2019s always a reason to send a little joy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>",
    "short_description": "Craft and sell charming postcards to your customers in a relaxing sandbox full of color and creativity. Carefully Stamped is a cozy job simulator where you are a postcard designer. Take on new orders, craft the cutest mail, write a wholesome note and collect stamps to send your postcards \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f\u2709\ufe0f",
